20
00:00:44.831 --> 00:00:46.896
Cioè, perdo, vado verso la morte.

21
00:00:47.291 --> 00:00:49.941
Quando comincio ad andare verso l'osteoporosi,

22
00:00:50.751 --> 00:00:52.461
